                                "sense_id": "a8ecc39b-fa02-3b9d-856e-169ed5876a63",
                                "text": "c. 1671, Thomas Carew, verses prefatory to Sandy's Psalms\nThen I no more shall court the verdant bay,\nBut the dry leaveless trunk on Golgotha."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98294f2d-d15b-4e32-80bb-0b580958581b",
                                "sense_id": "a8ecc39b-fa02-3b9d-856e-169ed5876a63",
                                "text": "The samples are quartered and are further divided, e.g. into needles, leaves and leaveless twigs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f6263e0-31a0-4606-9c9e-ed2b265f2a09",
                                "sense_id": "a8ecc39b-fa02-3b9d-856e-169ed5876a63",
                                "text": "It's almost noon. Arko left the area and entered the forest to hunt with the rest of the wolves. The area seemed pretty dead. Many leaveless trees. No bird chirping or leaves chattering. Arko was worried that they were going to fail the mission."
